        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_02",
      "hash64": "7CA6F867671129CA",
      "text": "Il faut qu’on parle avant que Kass se réveille...[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_gfather_01",
      "hash64": "CCF1168E029B9D2C",
      "text": "J’ai bien peur de ne pas être en mesure de\\nréparer correctement le masque d’Ogerpon...[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_gfather_02",
      "hash64": "CCF1198E029BA245",
      "text": "Il me manque un matériau indispensable.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_03",
      "hash64": "7CA6F96767112B7D",
      "text": "Papy vient tout juste de m’expliquer de quoi\\nil s’agit...[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_04",
      "hash64": "7CA6F26767111F98",
      "text": "En fait, pour réparer le masque, on a besoin\\nd’un [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Morceau de Cristal[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] venu du Lac Cristallin.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_05",
      "hash64": "7CA6F3676711214B",
      "text": "Sinon, on pourrait le rendre à Ogerpon\\nen l’état...[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_06",
      "hash64": "7CA6F467671122FE",
      "text": "Mais ce serait nettement plus sympa de le réparer\\nd’abord. Je pense que ça lui ferait plaisir ![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_select_01",
      "hash64": "8405B0BA68AFBAD7",
      "text": "Je suis d’accord !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_select_02",
      "hash64": "8405B1BA68AFBC8A",
      "text": "Ce serait gentil !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_07",
      "hash64": "7CA6F567671124B1",
      "text": "Maintenant que je connais la véritable histoire\\nd’Ogerpon... je veux tout faire pour lui redonner\\r\\nle sourire ![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 113,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_gfather_03",
      "hash64": "CCF1188E029BA092",
      "text": "Je suis convaincu qu’Ogerpon appréciera un tel\\ngeste de ta part, Roseille.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_08",
      "hash64": "7CA6EE67671118CC",
      "text": "On est d’accord ![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_brother_01",
      "hash64": "3B4BF93BAADEB523",
      "text": "B’jour, papy.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_gfather_04",
      "hash64": "CCF1138E029B9813",
      "text": "Bonjour, Kassis ![VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_09",
      "hash64": "7CA6EF6767111A7F",
      "text": "Kass ! Fais-toi petit, aujourd’hui, parce qu’on va...[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_brother_02",
      "hash64": "3B4BFA3BAADEB6D6",
      "text": "Ouais, ouais.\\nFais c’que tu veux, j’m’en fiche.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_10",
      "hash64": "7CAA7C6767143FED",
      "text": "Pardon ?! C’est à moi que tu parles comme ça ?![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_brother_03",
      "hash64": "3B4BFB3BAADEB889",
      "text": "...\\c\\nJ’m’arrache.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_11",
      "hash64": "7CAA7B6767143E3A",
      "text": "Je sais pas ce qu’il a, celui-là...\\nIl fait que de tirer la tronche.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_gfather_05",
      "hash64": "CCF1128E029B9660",
      "text": "Il s’est enfermé dans sa chambre sans même\\nmanger son souper...[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_12",
      "hash64": "7CAA7A6767143C87",
      "text": "Bah, il fait juste sa crise d’ado.\\nY a pas de quoi s’inquiéter.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_13",
      "hash64": "7CAA796767143AD4",
      "text": "Et ça veut aussi dire qu’il te collera moins\\naux bottes, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].\\r\\nÇa nous arrange pour notre quête secrète ![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_14",
      "hash64": "7CAA786767143921",
      "text": "Le Lac Cristallin est au sommet du Mont Strueux.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_15",
      "hash64": "7CAA77676714376E",
      "text": "Normalement, je préfère encore me faire piétiner\\npar une horde de Donphan plutôt que de laisser\\r\\nun[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e intrus[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e mettre les pieds sur notre montagne...\\c\\nMais... allez, je vais faire une exception pour toi ![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 159,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 216,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_16",
      "hash64": "7CAA7667671435BB",
      "text": "Allons gravir la montagne pour trouver\\nce Morceau de Cristal ![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_gfather_06",
      "hash64": "CCF1158E029B9B79",
      "text": "Les Pokémon qui vivent au Lac Cristallin sont\\npuissants ! Prenez bien garde à vous.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_student1_01",
      "hash64": "50F732182D96FB45",
      "text": "Hein ? Ton binôme et toi, vous avez trouvé\\nles trois pancartes ?!\\c\\nRoseille et moi, on en a vu qu’une seule !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_student2_01",
      "hash64": "A37171FC72A277B2",
      "text": "Qu’est-ce qu’il lui arrive, à Kassis ?\\nIl m’ignore quand j’essaie de lui parler...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_student3_01",
      "hash64": "7886FE07BBAF4367",
      "text": "Je passerais bien tout mon temps à la fête,\\nmais on a la course d’orientation à finir...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
